<title>FRANCE: Thomson/Aerospatiale surveillance system venture.</title>
<headline>Thomson/Aerospatiale surveillance system venture.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>French electronics company Thomson-CSF and aerospace group Aerospatiale said on Thursday they had signed an agreement to set up a joint venture to develop battlefield communication and surveillance systems.</p>
<p>They said in a joint statement each firm would have an equal share in the joint venture.</p>
<p>&quot;Aerospatiale and Thomson-CSF are pooling their competence and expertise necessary for the development of these future projects of ground surveillance, in the areas of prime contacting and engineering of aeronautical systems, on-board systems and ground systems,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
